00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.640
HE COULD STAB YOUR FAMILY!

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.000
STAB YOUR FRIENDS!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.240
STAB YOU IN THE BUTT!

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.920
And then he can take your shape.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:16.220
Th-the shape of your butt.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.560
He can take the shape of your butt,

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.600
and then assume your role

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.400
as society, as a butt.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.120
But either way,

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.460
MurderShifters is another game

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.540
