00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.220
Game.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:26.780
Jam.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.560
And it featured an interesting

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.060
game

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:29.780
style,

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.320
that was why... (more gibberish-) THAAAAAAHHH-

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.440
